      "html" : "<\/div><div class=\"clearfix\"><\/div><div id=\"rid-0-0-0-230129\" class=\"rbox Normal-Level\"><AnnotationDrawer recordId=\"0-0-0-230129\"><\/AnnotationDrawer><div>For the purpose of Section 501.3.1, an ADU shall be considered as an accessory building. Notwithstanding any inconsistent provisions of Section 501.3.2, where the main entrance to the ADU is set back no more than 100 feet from the curb line, a fire department access path shall be provided in accordance with <Link class=\"Jump\" to=\"{{ pathname: '\/codes\/newyorkcity\/latest\/NYCadmin\/0-0-0-230127', hash: '#JD_TableU103.8' }}\">Table U103.8<\/Link>. Protruding objects, projections, or overhangs shall not reduce such minimum clear width. Such access path shall open to the sky and be unobstructed between the street and such ADU. \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div><\/div><div class=\"clearfix\"><\/div><div id=\"rid-0-0-0-230126\" class=\"rbox Normal-Level\"><AnnotationDrawer recordId=\"0-0-0-230126\"><\/AnnotationDrawer><div><span style=\"font-weight: bold;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;display: inline;\"><a name=\"JD_TableU103.8\" id=\"JD_TableU103.8\" title=\"Table U103.8\"><\/a>Table U103.8<br><\/br>Minimum Clear Width of Fire Department Access Path and Maximum Number of Stories of an ADU<\/span><\/div><\/div><div class=\"clearfix\"><\/div><div id=\"rid-0-0-0-230201\" class=\"rbox Normal-Level\"><AnnotationDrawer recordId=\"0-0-0-230201\"><\/AnnotationDrawer><div style=\"margin-bottom=10pt\">&#160;<div class=\"xsl-table\">",
